{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Foundation.</b> A noun in construct state; the known form is יסוד חבוש בטמון, or it is in the pattern of זבול." "<b>המעלה.</b> A noun on the pattern of מקנה, משרה. So the meaning is: Ezra was the counsel of those who go up to Jerusalem, and the sense is: he counseled them to go up on the first of Nisan, and he arrived on the first of Av." "<b>And the word יסד</b> — like נוסדו, whose meaning is נועצו."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:07.857088500Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}